  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      262.97,
      401.9,
      286.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.97,
      401.87,
      322.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Immigrants and Emigrants(Amendment) Act, No. of 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      334.97,
      401.9,
      370.31
    ],
    "text": "2.The Immigrants and Emigrants Act (Chapter 351) ishereby amended by the insertion, immediately after section35 thereof, of the following new section:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      382.97,
      401.88,
      442.31
    ],
    "text": "35A. The Authority prescribed to issue orrenew passports may take finger printing forthe inclusion in the passport, from a personapplying for a passport or the renewal of apassport.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      454.97,
      401.9,
      478.31
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      336.91,
      453.57,
      374.78
    ],
